  <h3>Chips Combobox in Disabled State</h3>
  <p>
    When disabled, Chips Combobox becomes "frozen" and users are unable to
    interact with the module - search for, add, and remove chips.
  </p>
  <p>
    To turn on this state, add
    <code>aria-disabled="true"</code>
    to the outer element of the module. Additonally, you'll need to add
    the
    <code>disabled</code>
    attribute to all the buttons inside as well as the
    <code>input</code>
    element for combobox.
  </p>

