<h2>Set of List View Item Tiles</h2>

<p>
  To use a set of List Layout Item Tiles in a layout, you can use the
  <code>layout-grid</code>
  component with the specific responsive display rules per specifications.
  This will ensure proper spacing of Item Tiles in relation to each other and
  maintain the horizontally-oriented Item Tiles stacked across all breakpoints
  until it hits the
  <code>xl</code>
  breakpoint, where it displays two Item Tiles per row.
</p>

