  <h3>Large Phone input</h3>
  <p>
    Use the
    <code>phone-input--large</code>
    modifier to increase the size of the phone input. Also, use
    <code>btn--large, btn--large-fixed-height</code>
    and
    <code>textbox--large</code>
    for the button and textbox respectively.
  </p>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <span class="phone-input phone-input--large">
        <span class="listbox-button listbox-button--form">
