  <h3>See More File Preview Card</h3>

  <p>
    If the number of visual files exceeds the maximum display limit, a "See
    More" action button will appear at the center of the preview card, allowing
    you to view the additional files.
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <div style="width: 168px">
